{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_morgan_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_morgan_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "巨輪之下",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_morgan_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe5b0297db1ba9b536f745aa1331f3517931865885e2de28d884a06d3ac70ecd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "條子到底準備怎麼處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們、我們急著送老大去醫院，沒顧得上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那老大現在情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被貨箱砸到腦袋，當場吐了好大幾口血，直接就暈死過去了，估計傷得不輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰先動的手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們！而且打起來之後，那個傢伙絕對是故意把老大往堆高機上推的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*維多利亞粗口*，薩迪恩區這幫崽子，仗著發達了，都敢直接騎在我們的脖子上拉屎了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們留了兄弟在那邊，有消息馬上回來報信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，應該快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你們還指望條子主持公道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，先別說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，怎麼有外人，誰放她們進來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別誤會，聽說“黎恩兄弟”的黎恩老大受了傷，我們代表格拉斯哥幫過來探望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格拉斯哥幫......好像聽過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之有心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（都說了，人受傷肯定送去醫院了，你非要往人家據點跑。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒弄錯，幫陣不比探病有用？這叫雪中送炭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你小聲點。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報信的幫派分子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，呼——讓我喘口氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "條子怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報信的幫派分子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扣了我們幾個兄弟，還說等老大從醫院出來，直接去一趟警局，配合調查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報信的幫派分子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“諾伯特區的幫派分子跑到薩迪恩區的工廠鬧事，屬於跨城區惡性事件，必須嚴肅處理，首惡分子加重處罰。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報信的幫派分子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......反正是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，傷了老大的那個崽子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報信的幫派分子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "報信的幫派分子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "條子罰了那傢伙一點錢，就放他回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "*維多利亞粗口*\n、*維多利亞粗口*\n、*維多利亞粗口*\n，我沒詞了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家別著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早就說了，不能指望條子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，依老子看，現在直接衝到薩迪恩區，把害了黎恩老大的崽子揪出來，一拳打掉他半個腦袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幾個月我們吃的虧夠多了，這次有仇當場報！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說得對！這位格、格拉斯哥幫的朋友說得對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，找他們去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幫派分子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找他們去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我跟你們去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，維娜是讓我們來探望黎恩老大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是人家的事情，不要瞎摻和。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這關乎整個諾伯特區的臉面，每個人都該往前面站！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保羅，大杯生啤，再給我上兩杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，今天的啤酒有一股肥皂味，少喝點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你偷偷往裡面加了那個什麼“佐味膠囊”，我都發現了，懶得揭穿你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩根，你剛剛為什麼要攔著我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻漢娜，你還記不記得，上周在影廳發生的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些玻璃工作坊的傢伙跑到麥克拉倫的影廳消遣，租了帶子不還，還佔了我們的位置，和我們的人發生了衝突，鬧得引來了條子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但最後那些傢伙還是回到了薩迪恩區，連根毛都沒掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一想起來，我就生氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這還是在自己的地盤上，條子都能搞偏袒。今天他們的處理方式，我一點都不意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以這次才必須要報仇啊，我們為什麼要指望條子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人要指望條子。動動腦袋想想，漢娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天的事情鬧得這麼大，但處理得這麼不妥當，明顯就是故意的。人家估計就等你過去，然後一口氣把你剩下的勢力全收拾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問題的關鍵難道不是，條子為什麼一直要搞偏袒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩年，類似的事情還少嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*維多利亞粗口*，想不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保羅，來兩份啤酒湯，解解乏，暖暖胃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "端上來的時候，多撒點麵包屑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能我那個信封還是太薄了吧，入不了薩迪恩區勞工所那些老爺們的眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但那已經是我大半年的積蓄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想了，今天我請客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉——謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是得接著想辦法，看能不能搭上線，直接遷到薩迪恩區。不然每天都跨城區上工，也太麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說的是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，諾伯特區的人，現在反而需要跑到薩迪恩區的工廠和物流碼頭討生活，放在十年前，誰敢相信會發生這樣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒辦法，誰叫不景氣的是我們呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前，我們擁有倫蒂尼姆最大和最多的物流集散點，是倫蒂尼姆的大門。可自從薩迪恩區的輕工業發展起來，變化大家都看在眼裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "紡織品、玻璃工藝品、罐頭、電器......人家建了越來越多的工廠，能生產越來越多的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緊跟著建了更大和更多的物流集散點，諾伯特區就肉眼可見地不行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩年，街上只有兩種東西在增多，一種是無所事事的年輕人，這個幫那個派的，成天在影廳、桌球室和酒吧這些地方打轉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一種是濟貧院。但治標不治本，諾伯特區有多少人在靠領政府的失業救濟金過日子......倫蒂尼姆已經不再願意多管我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "摩根突然想到了被自己撕掉的那頁“摩根回憶錄”，啤酒滑下喉嚨，很多事從腦子裡翻了上來。\n那些接駁車和卸貨車、那些服裝店、那些雜誌攤......那些來來往往笑得很滿足的人。\n日落街酒店的門童從早到晚地忙碌著，連水都喝不上一口。\n來自維多利亞各地，甚至萊塔尼亞、卡西米爾的貨商和上流人物絡繹不絕地辦理入住。\n那是整個倫蒂尼姆的門臉。\n如今呢，如今？\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "摩根一口清空了杯子，諾伯特區的二十年，她的二十年，都順著啤酒滑進喉嚨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*維多利亞粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，明天還得上工呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明兒我想再去一趟勞工所，你跟我一起吧。聽我的，快點遷去薩迪恩區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂愁的工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你在想什麼，誰捨得呢？但這裡，說不定哪天就被倫蒂尼姆扔掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，剛剛那兩個人，你有沒有印象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們以前在物流碼頭當過磅員，土生土長的諾伯特人。我小的時候，可羡慕他們的工作了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果諾伯特區的人都不管諾伯特區，說不定哪天，真像這兩人說的一樣，它真的會被倫蒂尼姆扔出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以這次，我們不能不管不顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒說不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻漢娜，我隨時都可以跟你衝到薩迪恩區把打傷黎恩老大的那個人海扁一頓，甚至要了他的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但光靠打一場架，解決不了我們現在的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我最近一直在琢磨這件事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願你說的是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g2_glasgowoldroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，你幹嘛一直走來走去，是新買的沙發不好坐嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，你今天把大家叫過來，說有任務要佈置，什麼任務？終於要去替黎恩老大討回公道了嗎？這可都半個月了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，黎恩老大手下那些人，已經把“黎恩兄弟”解散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自己的老大被別人打成了重傷，現在都在醫院躺著，不報仇就算了，連據點都扔了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時不是還群情激奮，要一把火把對方的工廠給點了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們確實折騰了兩回，叫好了人，但還沒出諾伯特區，就被攔了下來，後來只能不了了之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這周，薩迪恩區的勞工所在諾伯特區加招了一批工人，我看了看名單，裡面就有“黎恩兄弟”的幾個頭目......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“黎恩兄弟”現在沒人能掌控大局，只能散夥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不怪他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“黎恩兄弟”以前罩著附近最大的幾個工房，收倉儲生意的保護費，能養活幾百個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但現在諾伯特區幾個市場都冷冷清清的，他們很難維持下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，其他人都叫過來了，在外面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。那我們準備出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“黎恩兄弟”的據點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格拉斯哥幫願意收留“黎恩兄弟”裡那些無路可去的夥計們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不懂嗎？漢娜，我們要接管“黎恩兄弟”的地盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是趁火打劫嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非要這麼說的話，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們為什麼要這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，路上再跟你解釋，兩三句話說不清楚。收拾一下出發吧，今天要跑很多地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只是“黎恩兄弟”的倉庫，影廳、桌球廳、飲冰室、飯店......諾伯特區半數的場子，我們都要去踩一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的拳頭，今天可有的忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諾伯特區的幫派雖然都沒有特別大，但大家從來都是各自照看好自己的地盤，井水不犯河水，遇到事情一致對外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以其他城區的人從來不敢惹我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜她畢竟不是諾伯特區的人，才來幾年。貝爾德，你和摩根，我們從小在這裡長大，怎麼能同意這麼做......對了，摩根呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天怎麼沒見到她？她知道這件事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，這就是摩根擬定的計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她有別的任務，我們分頭行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來了，出來吧，就我一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是誰啊......鬼鬼祟祟的，還把信封綁在石頭上扔進來，我窗戶都破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "字寫得真醜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我字寫得很醜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提著那麼大的砍刀，你想要幹什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我警告你不要亂來，附近都是人，我只要叫一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫唄。你不是已經看過我寫給你的信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該慶幸來的是我，而不是我的朋友，我是來找你“談談”的，談不攏我才會用到這把刀，放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再確認一下，薩迪恩區羅米紡織廠的伯尼，我沒找錯人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信封裡的東西，你是怎麼查到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說那些沒蓋章的貨品清單和寫著你名字的結算單據嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挺好查的。我花了半個月，就把你這大半年的紀錄都蒐集全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盜版錄影帶、未加工的香料、法術發生裝置、源石器械......這在薩迪恩區可都是嚴格管控的東西，就這麼被你帶了進來，嘖嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯尼先生，如果你們紡織廠的老闆羅米發現工頭在利用他工廠的物流管道幹走私生意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是會打斷你的腿，還是把你交給條子，讓條子打斷你的腿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你到底想怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半個月前，你就是在這裡和黎恩老大起了衝突，把他搞成了重傷，不會忘記了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人家現在還在醫院躺著，你不應該去道個歉嗎？還有，該付的賠償，連一便士也不能少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞了半天，是“黎恩兄弟”的人啊，等了你們半個月，才來了你一個出頭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你們不是已經解散了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諾伯特區已經沒有“黎恩兄弟”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫摩根，格拉斯哥幫的摩根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記住這兩個名字，我們以後還要經常打交道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們諾伯特區都落魄成什麼樣了，我們有什麼交道可打的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格什麼幫的小朋友，看看你身後的這列火車，十幾節車廂呢，一天的載貨量就能抵過你們老物流口岸一周的交易量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這些忙個不停的升降機和接駁車，還有後面那些連成一片的廠房，在諾伯特區看得到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，我幫你在我的工作坊找個活幹，你把信封裡那些證據的底單給我。划算吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格拉斯哥幫的智囊微笑著走到對方身邊，衝著他的肚子狠狠來了一拳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人的五官扭曲成一團，他捂著肚子，痛苦地蹲了下去。\n他抬頭看，年輕的菲林居高臨下地瞪著他，對方牙齒很白，但表情可不怎麼好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光盯著你拿刀的那隻手了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩迪恩區這麼厲害，你為什麼還要透過諾伯特區的門路走私這些貨呢？繞這麼大一圈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩迪恩區的關口審查很嚴格吧，有些東西，偏偏只能從我們這個已經衰落的老物流區才能進入倫蒂尼姆，是不是也很有意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩年，諾伯特區這些大大小小的幫派，只能勉強混日子。但以後，諾伯特區所有的場子，都歸我們格拉斯哥幫罩著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是還想做這個生意，就給我夾緊尾巴，別太狂妄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了。明天之前，如果你沒出現在醫院，你知道後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，提醒一句，我們這些人你欺負我，我欺負你，其實完全沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的薩迪恩區確實很熱鬧，那麼多煙囪、那麼多工人，很多人都羡慕你們的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，伯尼先生，你去過奧克特里格區嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你看過那些貴族的莊園和宅邸，你會發現，那裡面的道路可能比薩迪恩區的主幹道還要寬闊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們身上的衣服永遠乾淨，他們不需要上工，更不需要走私盜版錄影帶，但他們可以在比你身後的廠房面積更大的花園裡喝下午茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對他們來說，薩迪恩區也好，諾伯特區也好，可能完全沒有區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，誰能保證，薩迪恩區不會成為下一個諾伯特區呢？說不定再過幾年，其他城區的新產業被扶持起來，就會有人取代你們的地位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯尼先生，對倫蒂尼姆來說，我們這些傢伙，其實是一樣的，隨時都可以被扔出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們跟不上它的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的走私客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g2_glasgowoldroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩根，沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我為什麼會有事？有事的是伯尼那個傢伙，他現在應該已經在黎恩老大的病房了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜你們沒人跟我一起去，凱特·莫瑞根單挑薩迪恩區幾百走私犯，那可是大場面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，我會寫進回憶錄裡，到時候你們都能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救命，別吹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這邊怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“黎恩兄弟”剩下的那十幾個人也認維娜當了老大，以後你可以一邊看倉庫一邊寫書了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天拜訪了七個幫派，說服了三個，我和漢娜打服了四個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但諾伯特區的街市本身太過蕭條，靠著街市討生活的幫派也都是一盤散沙，很混亂，要想真的把大家都聚攏起來，還是太難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不急，慢慢來，這將是格拉斯哥幫的長線任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，謝謝你，謝謝你願意支持我做這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，我其實一直想問你一個問題......倫蒂尼姆，到底是誰的倫蒂尼姆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果少掉一塊兩塊地方，倫蒂尼姆其實不會有什麼變化，那我們這些傢伙，到底算什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諾伯特區，可能真的會被倫蒂尼姆徹底扔掉，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩根，說實話，我很難回答這個問題。倫蒂尼姆，乃至維多利亞......我也需要尋找這些問題的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我現在是格拉斯哥幫的一員，那我自然也是諾伯特區的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒法承諾什麼，但如果真有那麼一天，我不會看著它就那麼發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，維娜，你不需要向我們承諾什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要格拉斯哥幫都在一起，有什麼好怕的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是！要是中央區的那些貴族真敢做這麼噁心的事，我一定衝進他們的莊園，揍扁他們的臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我負責把滾燙的咖啡潑在他們的禮服上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放火的任務交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼說，摩根？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，到時候我肯定不攔你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說的也是，想那麼多幹嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們確實不是那些貴族，沒法修建什麼工程來振興這個已經衰落的城區，沒法頒布什麼政策來幫助生活在這裡的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但諾伯特區的男女老少，有自己能做到的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過話說回來，摩根，你這次的計劃，為什麼不提前跟我說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻漢娜，你那個塞滿了肌肉的腦袋......能理解得了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
